  "notes": "Dependency updates.\n\n## Changed\n- **Tauri 2.12.2** and its dialog and updater plugins (updater 2.14.0, still verifying every update against the release signing key before installing it).\n- **Frontend**: Nuxt 4.6.3, Nuxt UI 4.12.0, Vite 8.3.5 and vue-router 5.4.0, among others.\n- Smaller Rust updates: cc, objc2, serde_json and smallvec.\n\nNo change to how images are converted. Installers for Windows, macOS (Apple Silicon and Intel) and Linux are attached by the release workflow; existing installs update themselves."
